'''Brutal Slayer''' is the upgraded form of [[Slayer]] using the [[Bloodstone]]. Like all upgraded-weapons that use Bloodstone, its damage is increased by 0.2% for every 1 point of [[health]] the player is missing ''(not to be confused with health percentage)''.

* The primary attack is a wide 3-hit attack combo with double damage on the last hit.
* Its slower secondary attack is a thrust that deals 3x damage.

An upgraded Slayer will '''NOT''' keep its upgrade level when it is crafted into Brutal Slayer.

